  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Not built: the command list",
      "items": [
        "ADR 0004's list, sort keys and radix sort (sections 1-4) were measured first and dropped (PERF-007)",
        "About 152 draw commands a frame after Ebitengine's own merging, 17 target switches; the lit world is about 7, the UI most of the rest",
        "Its gate (1,500 calls a frame or more than 350 commands) is not met"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "The prepare pass",
      "items": [
        "Pipeline.prepare makes the chunk or map bakes, the wet and snow masks and the fog chunks before the first world draw",
        "The draws that follow only stamp, so no bake or pixel write falls between draws to the screen",
        "PERF-009: zoom 0.5 bake frames 148 to 102 target switches"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Batching inside layers",
      "items": [
        "AA discs, rings, lines, rects and convex polygons are one DrawTriangles32 each from a 3x3 white texel, so runs merge; concave polygons and colonist routes stay vector",
        "Queued crop units flush only when a later object's padded box touches them",
        "The light is a frame constant: SyncUniforms copies it only when it changes; creature cell sets rebuild only when a creature cell changed"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Evidence",
      "items": [
        "Sources pinned to commit fe0f8604c (local-only); the full layer order is in render-pipeline",
        "Command counts and timings are from the PERF-007 to PERF-009 ledgers; the HUD draws after the world and is not shown"
      ]
    }
  ]
